OL,3,AIndia's 'cockroach' party founder
OL,4,Adetained ahead of protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe founder of India's "cockroach"
OL,7,Fprotest movement, Abhijeet Dipke, has
OL,8,Fbeen detained in Delhi ahead of a
OL,9,Fplanned march in the heart of the
OL,10,Fcapital.
OL,12,FHis detention follows a police warning
OL,13,Fagainst holding Friday's march, with
OL,14,Fthousands of security personnel
OL,15,Fdeployed across the city to prevent the
OL,16,Fgathering.
OL,18,FDipke's youth-led Cockroach Janta Party
OL,19,F(CJP) is demanding the resignation of
OL,20,FIndia's election chief over allegations
OL,21,Fof voter list manipulation. The
OL,22,FElection Commission denies the charge.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
